  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the samphire in cold water and drain well.",
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the anchovy paste and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the gochujang, soy sauce, and water to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the samphire to the pot and cook for 5 minutes or until tender.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the samphire guk in a lacquerware bowl."
